{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_poppy": {
        "attack": "【扩展包】<#ff9028ff>钢铁大使<>：每<#ffb900ff>8秒<>普攻远远扔出圆盾，多造成<#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<>魔法伤害；捡起圆盾得<#66bb6aff>11~21%最大生命<>护盾。<#ff9028ff>坚定风采<>：双抗+16%（生命低于40%翻倍）；敌方英雄靠近时移速+40%，<#ffb900ff>2秒<>内冲进她身边的敌人被<#ef5350ff>击飞并缚地<>。",
        "skill2": "【扩展包】冲向敌方英雄，造成<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>物理伤害并推着他走；撞到墙上再受一次伤害并<#ef5350ff>眩晕1.75秒<>。",
        "ult": "【扩展包】身边有2个以上敌方英雄时砸地：<#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<>物理伤害并<#ef5350ff>击飞1秒<>；否则蓄力抡锤推出冲击波，打中的英雄受<#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>物理伤害并<#ef5350ff>被打回他家泉水方向<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_poppy": {
        "attack": "【擴充包】<#ff9028ff>鋼鐵使者<>：每<#ffb900ff>8秒<>普攻遠遠擲出圓盾，多造成<#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<>魔法傷害；撿起圓盾得<#66bb6aff>11~21%最大生命<>護盾。<#ff9028ff>堅定不移<>：雙抗+16%（生命低於40%翻倍）；敵方英雄靠近時移速+40%，<#ffb900ff>2秒<>內衝進她身邊的敵人被<#ef5350ff>擊飛並禁錮<>。",
        "skill2": "【擴充包】衝向敵方英雄，造成<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>物理傷害並推著他走；撞到牆上再受一次傷害並<#ef5350ff>暈眩1.75秒<>。",
        "ult": "【擴充包】身邊有2個以上敵方英雄時砸地：<#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<>物理傷害並<#ef5350ff>擊飛1秒<>；否則蓄力掄錘推出衝擊波，打中的英雄受<#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>物理傷害並<#ef5350ff>被打回他家泉水方向<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_poppy": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>Iron Ambassador<>: every <#ffb900ff>8s<> her attack throws her buckler for <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> more; picking it up gives a <#66bb6aff>11-21% max health shield<>. <#ff9028ff>Steadfast Presence<>: +16% armour and magic resist (doubled under 40% health); near enemies +40% move speed, and for <#ffb900ff>2s<> enemies dashing at her are <#ef5350ff>knocked up and grounded<>.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Charges an enemy champion for <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> physical damage and carries them; slammed into a wall they take it again and are <#ef5350ff>stunned 1.75s<>.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] With 2+ enemy champions close she slams the ground: <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> physical damage and <#ef5350ff>knock-up 1s<>. Otherwise she charges and swings a shockwave: champions hit take <#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> physical damage and are <#ef5350ff>sent flying toward their fountain<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_poppy": {
        "attack": "[확장] <#ff9028ff>강철의 외교관<>: <#ffb900ff>8초<>마다 기본 공격이 방패를 멀리 던져 <#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<> 마법 피해 추가; 주우면 <#66bb6aff>최대 체력 11~21%<> 보호막. <#ff9028ff>굳건한 태세<>: 방어력·마법 저항력 +16%(체력 40% 미만 2배); 적 근처 이동 속도 +40%, <#ffb900ff>2초<> 동안 돌진해 오는 적 <#ef5350ff>에어본·이동 불가<>.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 적 챔피언에게 돌진해 <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<> 물리 피해를 주고 밀고 나가며, 벽에 부딪히면 피해를 다시 주고 <#ef5350ff>1.75초 기절<>.",
        "ult": "[확장] 주변에 적 챔피언 2명 이상이면 땅을 내리쳐 <#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<> 물리 피해와 <#ef5350ff>1초 에어본<>; 아니면 모았다 휘둘러 충격파: 맞은 챔피언은 <#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<> 물리 피해를 입고 <#ef5350ff>자기 우물 쪽으로 날아감<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_poppy": {
        "attack": "【拡張】<#ff9028ff>鋼鉄の大使<>：<#ffb900ff>8秒<>ごとに通常攻撃で盾を遠くへ投げ<#a974ffff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>30%<>の魔法ダメージ追加；拾うと<#66bb6aff>最大体力11~21%<>のシールド。<#ff9028ff>ステッドファスト<>：物防・魔防+16%（体力40%未満で2倍）；敵が近いと移動速度+40%、<#ffb900ff>2秒<>突進してきた敵は<#ef5350ff>ノックアップ・移動阻害<>。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】敵チャンピオンへ突進し<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>60%<>の物理ダメージを与えて押し運ぶ；壁に叩きつけると再びダメージを与え<#ef5350ff>1.75秒スタン<>。",
        "ult": "【拡張】近くに敵チャンピオン2体以上なら地面を叩き<#ff9028ff>80<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>40%<>の物理ダメージと<#ef5350ff>1秒ノックアップ<>；そうでなければ溜めて衝撃波：当たったチャンピオンは<#ff9028ff>150<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70%<>の物理ダメージで<#ef5350ff>自陣の泉の方へ吹き飛ぶ<>。"
      }
    }
  }
}
